~ start
To fix the cider mill, the green gear must spin.
do animation_player.play(&"intro_green_gear")
Some gears can be moved by using your hook on levers.
do animation_player.play(&"intro_2")
Click again to skip this intro.
do animation_player.play(&"end")
=> END
